# Add Name Echo

## Goal Description
Modify [Program.cs](file:///c:/Users/jenar/MyFirstProject/Program.cs) to read input into a variable (specifically named `x` as requested or similar) and print it back to the console to show the name.

## Proposed Changes

### MyFirstProject

#### [MODIFY] [Program.cs](file:///c:/Users/jenar/MyFirstProject/Program.cs)
- Replace "Hello, World!" with:
    - `Console.Write("Enter your name: ");` (Optional prompt for better UX)
    - `string x = Console.ReadLine();`
    - `Console.WriteLine(x);`

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Run `dotnet run`.
- Enter a name when prompted.
- Verify the name is printed back.
